# Graphics-tier bench (tools/engine-tier-bench.mjs): Practice against Steady AI, four of the player's
# drops by number key and the AI's replies measured: falling discs, landing puffs, the frosted plate.
until 600 Make four in a row
frames 150
click =Play
until 120 Pick an opponent
frames 10
click =Steady AI
until 120 Your turn
frames 120
measure start
key Digit4 1
until 300 =Your turn
frames 40
key Digit3 1
until 300 =Your turn
frames 40
key Digit5 1
until 300 =Your turn
frames 40
key Digit2 1
until 300 =Your turn
frames 200
measure stop
